-- title:
--   Final graph case trees, data block 01
-- statement:
--   This bundle defines the fixed ordered array `sourceCaseBlock1` of $6465$ records with two finite Unicode strings, a graph-identifier field and a tree-code field, by concatenating its private literal subarrays numbered $53$ through $78$ in that order. Its first $25$ literal subarrays each contain $250$ entries, and its final subarray contains $215$. Concatenation preserves every listed entry and its order and performs no sorting or deduplication. The declaration has no parameters or hypotheses and defines data rather than a proposition. It asserts no decoding success, graph correspondence, geometric realization, feasibility, infeasibility or certificate correctness; it supplies no proof or lookup default.
--
--   **Source and scope.** Primary §9 pp.21–24; formal_lp/hypermap/verify_all.hl and main/prove_flyspeck_lp.hl:856–1037. Consecutive source graph/tree records reconstruct the same 19,715 graph trees and 43,078 leaves.
